## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Proc Set Timer|r 0.5.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Shows when a set's proc fires, how long it stays active and how long its cooldown has left -- for every timed effect of every set you wear, each on its own row. Nothing about any set is stored in the add-on: the worn sets, durations and cooldowns are read from the game's own item and bonus text in your game language, so a balance patch or a new set needs no update.
## Version: 0.5.1
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsProcSetTimer_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Parse.lua
Settings.lua

